      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CHEVRON STROLL (6) tends to drift back and work into the race, finishing out of the placings two back before charging home into the minors latest when third (22.57) in a Grade 4/5 at Geelong last time. Top chance in this line up. MISS MAXIMUS (5) found some support last start but struggled into fifth (30.86), beaten 8 lengths. Was in the money the start prior. Shapes as one to consider. FLUENT ACTION (1) hit the ground running off the tricky draw last start and was never headed (22.25) at Ballarat in a Grade 5 over 390m. Has a strong record out of this box with five wins and two minor placings from eight starts. Expected to feature again. GAMORA BALE (2) cannot be left out over a shorter trip.",
